  "content": "\n\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/refined-cooking\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://img.shields.io/badge/查看我的另一個連結 Refined Storage 和 Cooking for Blockheads 的模組-連結在底部-e78a4e?labelColor=7f1620&style=for-the-badge\" alt=\"精緻烹飪宣傳圖\" width=\"800\" height=\"28\"></a></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><img src=\"https://www.bisecthosting.com/images/CF/Applied_Cooking/BH_AC_Header.png\" alt=\"應用烹飪標頭\" width=\"1125\" height=\"378\"></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><img src=\"https://img.shields.io/badge/支援 Forge-1.19 | 1.18-edbd7e?labelColor=154a48&style=for-the-badge\" alt=\"Minecraft 版本徽章\" width=\"266\" height=\"28\"> <img src=\"https://img.shields.io/badge/安裝於-客戶端與伺服器-edbd7e?labelColor=154a48&style=for-the-badge\" alt=\"應用烹飪安裝徽章\" width=\"240\" height=\"28\"></p>\n<p><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmeloncube.net%252fsebastrn\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://www.bisecthosting.com/images/CF/Applied_Cooking/BH_AC_Promo.png\" alt=\"應用烹飪宣傳圖\" width=\"1808\" height=\"268\"></a></p>\n<p><img src=\"https://www.bisecthosting.com/images/CF/Applied_Cooking/BH_AC_Description.png\" alt=\"應用烹飪說明\" width=\"1808\" height=\"179\"></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px\">一款讓應用能源 2 (Applied Energistics 2) 與 Cooking for Blockheads 協同運作的新模组！</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px\">新增了一個方塊：廚房工作站（Kitchen Station）！</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px\">在將廚房工作站作為 CFB 廚房網路的一部分放置之前，您需要像設定無線終端一樣配置它。對於 1.20 以下的 Minecraft 版本，您需在 AE2 安全終端中進行此設定。對於 1.20+ 的 Minecraft 版本，則需在 AE2 無線接入點中完成設定。</span>&nbsp;</p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px\">連接完成後，您就可以直接在烹飪桌上從 AE2 網路庫存中消耗物品。</span></p>\n<p><img src=\"https://www.bisecthosting.com/images/CF/Applied_Cooking/BH_AC_Recipes.png\" alt=\"應用烹飪配方\" width=\"1808\" height=\"824\"></p>\n<h2>方塊</h2>\n<div class=\"spoiler\">\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>&nbsp;</th>\n<th style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><strong>已連線</strong></span></th>\n<th style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><strong>未連線</strong></span></th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><strong>廚房工作站&nbsp;</strong></span></td>\n<td><img src=\"https://i.ibb.co/19RvTpK/appliedcooking-kitchenstation-connected.png\" alt=\"廚房工作站已連線\" width=\"397\" height=\"376\"></td>\n<td><img src=\"https://i.ibb.co/brxMbvZ/appliedcooking-kitchenstation-disconnected.png\" alt=\"廚房工作站未連線\" width=\"430\" height=\"376\"></td>\n</tr>\n</tbody>\n</table>\n</div>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p><img src=\"https://www.bisecthosting.com/images/CF/Applied_Cooking/BH_AC_Screenshot.png\" alt=\"應用烹飪截圖\" width=\"1808\" height=\"824\"></p>\n<h2>社群平台</h2>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/members/itssebastrn/projects\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://img.shields.io/static/v1?label=&message=ItsSebastrn&color=edbd7e&labelColor=154a48&style=for-the-badge&logo=curseforge&logoColor=white\" alt=\"Sebastrn 的 Curseforge\" width=\"148\" height=\"28\"></a> <a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fx.com%252fItsSebastrn\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://img.shields.io/static/v1?label=&message=@ItsSebastrn&color=edbd7e&labelColor=154a48&style=for-the-badge&logo=x&logoColor=white\" alt=\"Sebastrn 的 Twitter\" width=\"159\" height=\"28\"></a> <a href=\"https://www.youtube.com/channel/UC46TYUp8WpcFub8NxuGA66A\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://img.shields.io/static/v1?label=&message=Sebastrn&color=edbd7e&labelColor=154a48&style=for-the-badge&logo=youtube&logoColor=white\" alt=\"Sebastrn 的 YouTube\" width=\"125\" height=\"28\"></a> <a href=\"https://www.twitch.tv/itssebastrn\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://img.shields.io/static/v1?label=&message=ItsSebastrn&color=edbd7e&labelColor=154a48&style=for-the-badge&logo=twitch&logoColor=white\" alt=\"Sebastrn 的 Twitch\" width=\"148\" height=\"28\"></a> <a href=\"https://github.com/Sebastrn\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://img.shields.io/static/v1?label=&message=Sebastrn&color=edbd7e&labelColor=154a48&style=for-the-badge&logo=github&logoColor=white\" alt=\"Sebastrn 的 GitHub\" width=\"125\" height=\"28\"></a></p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/refined-cooking\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://www.bisecthosting.com/images/CF/Applied_Cooking/BH_AC_RCLink.png\" alt=\"精緻烹飪宣傳圖\" width=\"1808\" height=\"268\"></a></p>",
